body:
The Storybook imports use incorrect relative paths starting with `./` (e.g., `./custom/config-panel-renderer`, `./hooks/use-config-draft`). Stories are located in `packages/components/src/stories/` while the imports target files in sibling directories, so imports should use `../` instead of `./`. For example: `../custom/config-panel-renderer`, `../hooks/use-config-draft`, `../types/config-panel`. This will cause module resolution errors.
```suggestion
import { ConfigPanelRenderer } from '../custom/config-panel-renderer';
import { ConfigFieldRenderer } from '../custom/config-field-renderer';
import { useConfigDraft } from '../hooks/use-config-draft';
import type { ConfigPanelSchema, ConfigField } from '../types/config-panel';
```
